  (descr "ESP32-C3 Super Mini, two 1x8 rows, 2.54 mm pitch, 15.24 mm between rows. Top view, USB at the top: pads 1-8 left row top to bottom GPIO5 GPIO6 GPIO7 GPIO8 GPIO9 GPIO10 GPIO20 GPIO21, pads 9-16 right row top to bottom 5V GND 3V3 GPIO4 GPIO3 GPIO2 GPIO1 GPIO0. This footprint is the power-right (mirrored) module. The reference build's modules are power-left (rows swapped); their socket is ESP32-C3_SuperMini_Socket_PowerLeft. Board outline 18 x 22.52 mm centred on the pins; the USB overhang length is UNCONFIRMED")
